      "id": "19192",
      "key": "SFCC-743",
      "summary": "Product Card Group – PWA Component",
      "description": "As a Developer, \n\n\nI want a reusable \nproduct-card-group\n React component built to the Zimmermann Design System 2026 spec, \n\n\nso that it can render a labelled group of product cards across multiple pages including PDP, PLP, and Homepage.\nThe component renders an optional section header (title + link) and a responsive row of ProductCard components (SFCC-236). It does not own the product data or navigation logic — it receives a product array, title, and link label as props. Whether the underlying data comes from SFCC merchandising logic, a Contentful-curated editorial slot, or a personalisation engine is irrelevant to the component.\nProps in scope:\nProp\nValues\nNotes\ndisplay\n3, 4, 6\nControls number of product cards rendered\nsize\nDesktop, Mobile\nControls layout breakpoint\nshowTitleAndLink\ntrue, false\nToggles the entire section header\nshowLink\ntrue, false\nIndependently toggles the link within the header; only applies when showTitleAndLink=true\ntitle\nstring\nSection heading text\nlinkLabel\nstring\nLink text e.g. Shop All, View More\nExamples of usage: More from this category and Recommended for you on the PDP.",
      "status": {
        "name": "Tech design",
        "category": "To Do",
        "color": "blue-gray"
      },
      "priority": {
        "name": "High"
      },
      "assignee": {
        "display_name": "Marcel Angelo Navarro",
        "name": "Marcel Angelo Navarro",
        "email": "marcel.a.n.navarro@accenture.com",
        "avatar_url": "https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/482e2e100517026f4980d6455214aa11?d=https%3A%2F%2Favatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net%2Finitials%2FMN-6.png"
      },
      "labels": [
        "Custom",
        "Squad-A"
      ],
      "customfield_10231": {
        "value": {
          "type": "doc",
          "version": 1,
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "content": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "text": "1. Given the component is rendered with a valid display prop, when it mounts, then the correct number of ProductCard instances are rendered matching the display value."
                },
                {
                  "type": "hardBreak"
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "text": "2. Given showTitleAndLink=true and showLink=true, when the component renders, then the section header displays both the title and the link using the linkLabel value."
                },
                {
                  "type": "hardBreak"
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "text": "3. Given showTitleAndLink=true and showLink=false, when the component renders, then the title is displayed but no link is shown."
                },
                {
                  "type": "hardBreak"
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "text": "4. Given showTitleAndLink=false, when the component renders, then neither the title nor the link are displayed."
                },
                {
                  "type": "hardBreak"
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "text": "5. Given the component is rendered with an empty or missing product array, when it mounts, then it renders no product cards and no error is thrown."
                },
                {
                  "type": "hardBreak"
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "text": "6. Given the component is rendered at size=Desktop or size=Mobile, when it mounts, then the layout matches the corresponding Figma design spec variant."
                },
                {
                  "type": "hardBreak"
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "text": "7. Given the section header is visible, when rendered, then the title is a semantically correct heading element and the link is a native anchor element with descriptive text."
                },
                {
                  "type": "hardBreak"
                },
                {
                  "type": "hardBreak"
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "text": "Accessibility"
                },
                {
                  "type": "hardBreak"
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "text": "8. Given the component is interactive, when a keyboard user navigates to the link, then it is reachable and activatable via keyboard alone."
                },
                {
                  "type": "hardBreak"
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "text": "9. Given the component renders product cards, when a screen reader traverses the group, then each card is distinguishable and the group is appropriately labelled."
                },
                {
                  "type": "hardBreak"
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "text": "10. Given the component is rendered, when tested against WCAG 2.1 AA criteria, then it passes with no violations."
                }
              ],
              "attrs": {
                "localId": "a30059852f7f"
              }
            }
          ]
        }
      }
